# Testing Requirements

**Unit test structure, naming, reference values:** hexpal-testing.mdc. HexPal uses zero system permissions (hexpal-project).

## Before Committing
- Test on latest macOS version
- Test with multiple displays
- Test with different color profiles
- Verify hotkey works reliably
- Check memory usage
- Verify no crashes
- **Accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA):** Test with VoiceOver (Cmd+F5). Full pick → copy flow must be navigable, all content announced, no focus traps.

## Test Scenarios
- Pick color from browser
- Pick color from desktop app
- Pick color from image viewer
- Pick color across multiple displays
- Test hotkey from different apps
- Test clipboard copy functionality

## Error Testing
- Test hotkey conflicts (KeyboardShortcuts needs no permissions, but keys can conflict with other apps)
- Test multi-display edge cases
- Test color profile conversions
- Test memory under load
